Dear Member,

The Association's Annual General Meeting takes place on Thursday 6 November at 18:30 at the Quay Rooms. Members unable to attend in person may appoint a proxy using the online form.

Resolutions this year include the adoption of the revised trustee code and a change to the subscription banding.

Appoint your proxy or register attendance here:
https://caldermere-trustees-agm.org/agm2026/proxy

The form closes at noon on 3 November.

